[L25] Human intuition is fundamentally three-dimensional. Our sensory and cognitive structures are adapted to 3D space and 1D time. Yet, nature presents itself as fundamentally four-dimensional: spacetime is not 3D evolving in time — it is \textbf{fully 4D from the start}.
[L26]
[L27] To theorize rigorously in 4D requires a conceptual shift:
[L28] \begin{itemize}
[L29]     \item Objects are extended in time as well as in space.
