[L37] \section*{1. 4D Objects: Worldtubes, Not Worldlines}
[L38]
[L39] \textbf{Rule 1}: 
[L40] \begin{quote}
[L41] A 4D object is not something that ``exists over time.'' It \textit{is} its 4D extension — a worldtube, not a point tracing a worldline.
