[L47] \end{quote}
[L48]
[L49] Particles are not points moving through space; they are extended 4D structures whose ``states'' at a given time are slices through their worldtubes.
[L50]
[L51] \section*{2. Vibrations and Dynamics in 4D}
[L52]
[L53] \textbf{Rule 3}:
[L54] \begin{quote}
[L55] Dynamics are just 4D shapes, not processes. A wave is a 4D spiral.
