I think the eventual research system should contain these functional laboratories.

1. Worldline Recovery Lab

Its job is to reconstruct the “best of” the existing work:

phenomenon mapped;
control case;
admitted modification;
derivation chain;
numerical result;
benchmarks tested;
cross-sector consequences;
current confidence;
exact source locations;
unresolved dependencies.

